 "licensing": "The clone reproduces the layout AND real identity of a live company (Dovetail Research Pty. Ltd.): real customer logos (a 368-logo wall), real customer names and stories, named testimonials, review-site ratings and awards, employee/speaker photos, an analyst (Forrester TEI) study, YouTube video ids and third-party form/registration links. Long-form copy in the clone is already placeholder text of the original's length. Reference mode may use the recorded material as evidence ONLY to reconstruct the clone. Generated pages must never reproduce, trace or imitate: real logos or wordmarks, real people's photos or likenesses, real ratings/awards/certifications, the source's product names, copy, URLs or live endpoints, or its commercial display face (PP Mondwest). Use the generation-safe roles and draw new material in the same visual language (near-black #0A0A0A surfaces, #0044FF blue, 8px radii, mono uppercase eyebrows, pixel/ASCII decoration).",
 "forbiddenInAllModes": [
  "store.badge",
  "link.live-endpoint",
  "copy.source-longform"
 ],
